{"sha": "15a7253d6436f5595c3db4389b66b8ba70997ff1174f10fb513781cc6e26d181", "body": ["\\textbf{2.} $G = \\langle\\sigma\\rangle$ 为 $16$ 阶循环群；", "$H_k = \\langle\\sigma^{2^k}\\rangle$ 的阶为 $2^{4-k}$，且", "$[H_k : H_{k+1}] = 2$。由基本定理", "（\\cref{thm:b3:galois:fundamental}），$L_k = L^{H_k}$ 满足", "$[L_k : \\Q] = [G : H_k] = 2^k$，故每个 $[L_{k+1}:L_k] = 2$。", "", "\\textbf{3.} $\\zeta \\in L = L_4$ 位于 $\\Q$ 的一串二次", "扩张之上：由\\cref{thm:b3:galois:wantzel}，$\\zeta$ 可", "构造；正 $17$ 边形的顶点为 $\\zeta^k$。", "", "\\textbf{4.} $\\sigma^2$ 将指数乘以 $9$；", "$\\eta_0$ 的指数为 $3$ 的偶次幂，", "\\[", "\\{3^{2k} \\bmod 17\\} = \\{1, 9, 13, 15, 16, 8, 4, 2\\},", "\\]", "该集合在乘以 $9 = 3^2$ 下不变；故 $\\eta_0$", "（$\\eta_1$ 同理）被 $H_1 =", "\\langle\\sigma^2\\rangle$ 固定：$\\eta_0, \\eta_1 \\in L_1$，", "为二次域。$\\sigma$ 把偶次幂映为奇次幂，它交换 $\\eta_0,", "\\eta_1$。于是 $\\eta_0 + \\eta_1$ 与 $\\eta_0\\eta_1$ 被", "$G$ 中全部元素固定，故为有理数；$\\eta_0, \\eta_1$ 是一个", "有理系数二次多项式的根。", "", "\\textbf{5.} $\\eta_0 + \\eta_1 = \\sum_{c=1}^{16}\\zeta^c = -1$。乘积", "展开为 $64$ 项 $\\zeta^{a + b}$，$a$ 属于偶数集，", "$b$ 属于奇数集。没有哪一项是 $\\zeta^0$：$b = -a$", "不可能，因为 $-1 = 16 = 3^8$ 是\\emph{偶}次幂，故", "$-a$ 仍属于偶数集。于是 $\\eta_0\\eta_1 = \\sum_{c \\neq 0}", "n_c\\zeta^c$，$\\sum n_c = 64$；作用 $\\sigma$ 固定", "$\\eta_0\\eta_1$（它交换两个因子），并置换 $\\zeta^c$，", "在全部 $c \\neq 0$ 上传递地，故所有 $n_c$ 相等：$n_c", "= 4$，且 $\\eta_0\\eta_1 = 4\\sum_{c\\neq0}\\zeta^c = -4$。", "", "\\textbf{6.} $\\eta_{0,1}$ 满足 $Y^2 + Y - 4 = 0$：$\\frac{-1 \\pm", "\\sqrt{17}}2$。数值上，配对共轭指数，", "$\\eta_0 = 2\\bigl(\\cos\\tfrac{2\\pi}{17} + \\cos\\tfrac{4\\pi}{17} +", "\\cos\\tfrac{8\\pi}{17} + \\cos\\tfrac{16\\pi}{17}\\bigr) \\approx 1.56", "> 0$: $\\eta_0 = \\frac{-1+\\sqrt{17}}2$, $\\eta_1 =", "\\frac{-1-\\sqrt{17}}2$，且 $L_1 = \\Q(\\eta_0) = \\Q(\\sqrt{17})$。", "", "\\textbf{7.} 指数集：$\\beta_0$ 为 $\\{1, 13, 16, 4\\}$ =", "$3^{4k}$ 的幂；$\\beta_2$ 为 $\\{9, 15, 8, 2\\}$ = $9 \\times$ 该", "集合。并集即偶数集：$\\beta_0 + \\beta_2 = \\eta_0$；同理", "$\\beta_1 + \\beta_3 = \\eta_1$。乘以 $13 = 3^4$", "使每个 $\\beta_i$ 的指数集不变：被 $H_2 =", "\\langle\\sigma^4\\rangle$ 固定；而 $\\sigma^2$（$\\times 9$）将", "$\\{1,13,16,4\\}$ 映为 $\\{9, 15, 8, 2\\}$，交换 $\\beta_0,", "\\beta_2$。", "", "\\textbf{8.} 展开 $\\beta_0\\beta_2$，十六个指数", "之和", "\\[", "\\{1,13,16,4\\} + \\{9,15,8,2\\} =", "\\{10,16,9,3,\\ 5,11,4,15,\\ 8,14,7,1,\\ 13,2,12,6\\}", "\\]", "恰好覆盖 $1, \\dots, 16$ 各一次：$\\beta_0\\beta_2 =", "\\sum_{c\\ne0}\\zeta^c = -1$。作用 $\\sigma$（它把", "$\\beta_0 \\mapsto \\beta_1$，$\\beta_2 \\mapsto \\beta_3$：", "指数 $\\times 3$），$\\beta_1\\beta_3 = \\sigma(\\beta_0\\beta_2)", "= -1$。", "", "\\textbf{9.} $\\beta_0, \\beta_2$ 满足 $Y^2 - \\eta_0 Y - 1 = 0$，", "故 $\\beta_0 = \\frac{\\eta_0 + \\sqrt{\\eta_0^2 + 4}}2$（数值上", "$\\beta_0 = 2\\cos\\frac{2\\pi}{17} + 2\\cos\\frac{8\\pi}{17} \\approx", "2.05 > 0$，取 $+$ 号）。同理 $\\beta_1 = \\frac{\\eta_1 +", "\\sqrt{\\eta_1^2 + 4}}2 \\approx 0.344$（数值检验再次确定", "符号）。$L_2 = L_1(\\beta_0)$，是 $L_1$ 上的二次扩张。", "", "\\textbf{10.} $\\gamma_0 + \\gamma_1 = \\zeta + \\zeta^{16} +", "\\zeta^{13} + \\zeta^4 = \\beta_0$。又有", "\\[", "\\gamma_0\\gamma_1 = (\\zeta + \\zeta^{16})(\\zeta^{13} + \\zeta^4)", "= \\zeta^{14} + \\zeta^{5} + \\zeta^{12} + \\zeta^{3} = \\beta_1 .", "\\]", "故 $\\gamma_0, \\gamma_1$ 满足 $Y^2 - \\beta_0Y + \\beta_1 = 0$；", "数值上 $\\gamma_0 = 2\\cos\\frac{2\\pi}{17} \\approx 1.865 >", "\\gamma_1 \\approx 0.185$：$\\gamma_0 = \\frac{\\beta_0 +", "\\sqrt{\\beta_0^2 - 4\\beta_1}}2$。", "", "\\textbf{11.} 逐步代入：", "\\[", "\\eta_0 = \\frac{-1 + \\sqrt{17}}2,", "\\quad", "\\beta_0 = \\frac{\\eta_0 + \\sqrt{\\eta_0^2 + 4}}2,", "\\quad", "\\beta_1 = \\frac{\\eta_1 + \\sqrt{\\eta_1^2 + 4}}2,", "\\quad", "\\cos\\frac{2\\pi}{17} = \\frac{\\beta_0 + \\sqrt{\\beta_0^2 -", "4\\beta_1}}4 .", "\\]", "数值上：$\\sqrt{17} \\approx 4.1231$，$\\eta_0 \\approx", "1.5616$，$\\eta_1 \\approx -2.5616$，$\\beta_0 \\approx 2.0494$，", "$\\beta_1 \\approx 0.3441$，$\\beta_0^2 - 4\\beta_1 \\approx", "2.8234$，且 $\\cos\\frac{2\\pi}{17} \\approx \\frac{2.0494 +", "1.6803}4 \\approx 0.93242$ --- 与 $\\cos\\frac{2\\pi}{17} =", "0.93247\\dots$：微小差异源于", "中间式子中的舍入；多取几位即可复现", "$0.932472$。", "", "\\textbf{12.} 该构造要求 $[L:\\Q] = p - 1$ 为", "$2$ 的幂，使得由指数为 $2$ 的子群所成的完整链", "存在。若 $p = 2^m + 1$ 是质数，且 $m = ab$，其中 $a$ 为奇数且 $>", "1$：$x + 1 \\mid x^a + 1$ 在 $x = 2^b$ 处表明 $2^b + 1$ 真", "整除 $p$ --- 不可能。于是 $m$ 为 $2$ 的幂：$p =", "2^{2^t} + 1$，即\\emph{费马质数}（$3, 5, 17, 257, 65537$，", "\\dots）。反之，对此类 $p$，$\\varphi(p) = 2^{2^t}$，且", "沿用 1--3 题的论证（或", "\\cref{cor:b3:galois:impossible}）即得：正 $p$ 边形", "可构造，当且仅当 $p$ 为费马质数。", ""]}